qYW8lmKPEoUOh7bOExCrHuQ1DhK.jpg"},{"id":1082379,"name":"Caroline Gaget","role":"The Servant","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jwNc4CBwKPiR93TDwfRSRqLW57S.jpg"},{"id":3259001,"name":"Armand Eloi","role":"The Opera Controller","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xRjbHoxZ0QPxtkFSc3G3pnqroKL.jpg"},{"id":1170756,"name":"Jean-Paul Bordes","role":"The Director of \"Réveil\"","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vObdK9D1BH2fmT7PvkAZBBsb3Bb.jpg"},{"id":2096670,"name":"Julien Sibre","role":"The Bas Rouge Gatekeeper","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/teJXShCBpcMDYLjozcqWUU9RbOB.jpg"},{"id":1559329,"name":"Éric Guého","role":"The Argentinian"},{"id":1270190,"name":"Capucine Daumas","role":"The Lyrical Singer"},{"id":2229483,"name":"Jérémie Bédrune","role":"Editor of \"Le Corsaire\"","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4H1EEFJFmxUqx6o73YjDl3drSI9.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Illusioni perdute","overview":"Lucien è un giovane poeta in cerca di fortuna. Nutre grandi speranze per il suo futuro ed è deciso a prendere le redini del proprio destino abbandonando la tipografia di famiglia e tentando la sorte a Parigi sotto l’ala protettrice della sua mecenate. Rifiutato dalla società aristocratica parigina per le sue umili origini e la sua relazione pericolosa con la baronessa, si ritrova solo, senza un soldo, affamato e umiliato e cerca vendetta scrivendo articoli controversi. All'interno della Parigi tanto ambita, trova un mondo cinico dove tutto – e tutti – possono essere comprati e venduti.","tagline":"La critica è facile e l’arte è difficile"},{"language":"en-US","title":"Lost Illusions","overview":"Lucien de Rubempré, a young, lower-class poet, leaves his family's printing house for Paris. Soon, he learns the dark side of the arts business as he tries to stay true to his dreams.","tagline":"Criticism is easy, and art is difficult"},{"language":"fr-FR","overview":"Lucien est un jeune poète inconnu dans la France du XIXème siècle. Il a de grandes espérances et veut se forger un destin. Il quitte l'imprimerie familiale de sa province natale pour tenter sa chance à Paris, au bras de sa protectrice. Bientôt livré à lui-même dans la ville fabuleuse, le jeune homme va découvrir les coulisses d'un monde voué à la loi du profit et des faux-semblants. Une comédie humaine où tout s'achète et se vend, la littérature comme la presse, la politique comme les sentiments, les réputations comme les âmes. Il va aimer, il va souffrir, et survivre à ses illusions.","tagline":"La critique est aisée, mais l'art est difficile."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7HojwJdIsJYQrc1rJ3DE8h0Qb7E.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gsqJEai2EvRfuMzxSb6uSgRwrRN.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":660000,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"fr-FR","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7HojwJdIsJYQrc1rJ3DE8h0Qb7E.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7HojwJdIsJYQrc1rJ3DE8h0Qb7E.jpg","language":"it","width":666,"height":999},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7HojwJdIsJYQrc1rJ3DE8h0Qb7E.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7HojwJdIsJYQrc1rJ3DE8h0Qb7E.jpg","language":"it","width":666,"height":999},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qlh7ASnPwJ24473Xgz1oG2JaeQu.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qlh7ASnPwJ24473Xgz1oG2JaeQu.jpg","language":"it","width":1984,"height":2835},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/j6aoajcpDQUVvUhP8VGd5Fneepb.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/j6aoajcpDQUVvUhP8VGd5Fneepb.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000}]},"en":{"status":"available","sel